==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''39 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats! We did it, all thanks to you!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between November 5th (11:00am) and November 19th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Introducing "Seeing Red" Stages!'''}}<br>
An all-new challenge for experienced Battle Cats players! A horde of nasty Red baddies is coming to attack the Cats! Can you hold them back?

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・New Stage: "Seeing Red"'''}}<br>
Available November 5th (11am) thru November 19th (11am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・New Stage: "Seeing Red"'''}}<br>
Available November 6th (11am) thru November 19th (11am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・New Stage: "Seeing Red III"'''}}<br>
Available November 7th (11am) thru November 19th (11am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・New Stage: "Seeing Red ∞"'''}}<br>
Available November 8th (11am) thru November 19th (11am)!

Only you can protect the peace of the Cat Empire against this rush of Red enemies!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (11/6, 11/8, 11/10, 11/12, 11/14, 11/16, 11/18)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (11/5, 11/7, 11/9, 11/11, 11/13, 11/15, 11/17, 11/19)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''11/7, 11/10, 11/13, 11/16 and 11/19'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Login daily to earn items and a Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up another login stamp! More login stamps will get you bigger and better prizes, including a Rare Ticket!<br>
<small><small>※Up to 14 Stamps can be earned during this event.</small></small>

